# Copy this structure to the persistent /config/config.yaml.
# IMPORTANT: replace YOUR_PASSWORD with the real camera password.
#
# Phòng khách:
#   RTSP host: 192.168.0.107
#   Motion: binary_sensor.c6n_e17394610_motion
#
# Sân:
#   RTSP host: 192.168.0.122
#   Motion: binary_sensor.h6c_bf2378127_motion
#
# Notifications:
#   - Before enabling notifications, add 'homeassistant_config:rw' to this
#     addon's map: in its own config.yaml (Settings > Add-ons > Fall AI >
#     Info), otherwise snapshot images cannot reach HA's www/ folder.
#   - notifications.mobile.services: the notify.* service(s) shown under
#     Settings -> Devices & services -> Mobile App on the phone(s) you want alerted.
#   - notifications.zalo: fill in thread_id and account_selection the same
#     way your existing zalo_bot.send_message automations do (see the
#     conversation/automation you already have that calls zalo_bot).
